          "",
          "# OLS Regressor with Spatial Statistics - Spatial AI in Oracle Machine Learning for Python (OML4Py)",
          "",
          "Oracle Machine Learning for Python (OML4Py) makes the Python environment ready for the enterprise. OML4Py integrates Python with Oracle Autonomous Database, enabling the use of Python for machine learning and visualization from database tables and views. Spatial AI is a feature of OML4Py providing algorithms and APIs to analyze, make predictions, and detect patterns from geospatial data. ",
          "",
          "In this notebook, you work with the OLS Regressor which performs ordinary least squares regression without spatial context and returns spatial statistics useful for determining whether a spatial regression would provide more reliable predictions. Some experience with spatial statistics is needed to evaluate the statistics. For an automated evaluation and determination, please see the sample notebook on Spatial Adaptive Regressor.",
