          "%md",
          "",
          "",
          "",
          "",
          "Next you train an OLS model to predict MEDIAN_INCOME and supply spatial weights. The OLSRegressor does not account for spatial context in its predictions. However by including spatial weights as a parameter to OLSRegressor, a set of spatial statistics is generated which indicates whether a spatial regression model would result in more reliable preditions. The choice of a spatial weights definition impacts the results, and experiments are genenerally needed to arrive at an optimal choice.",
          "",
          " "
        ],
        "selectedVisualization" : "html",
        "visualizationConfig" : null,
        "hideCode" : true,
