        "message" : [
          "%md",
          "",
          "The two main methods of incorporating spatial dependence into OLS regression are as follows: ",
          "",
          "*   The Spatial Lag algorithm introduces the spatial lag of the dependent variable into the linear regression equation. This is suitable when dependent variable values are influenced by neighboring dependent variable values.",
          "*   The Spatial Error algorithm introduces the spatial lag in the error term of the linear regression equation. This is suitable when the residuals of dependent variable values are influenced by neighboring dependent variable residual values.",
          "",
          "",
          "Since your model was trained with spatial weights, spatial statistics are included in the result to determine whether a spatial algorithm would be preferred. Review the model summary and observe spatial statistics in the last section. "
